<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lamaur Corp downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lamaur Corp downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it downgraded Lamaur Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Said in a report sees company's near-term results coming under pressure as company spends on brand development in high margin products.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately trading after closing Friday at 3-9/16.</p>
</text>
